✅ 7. Validation & Health Check
Confirm BOXI URL is accessible.

Validate that services (CMS, APS, Job Server) are running.

Check /var/log/boxi/install.log for install success.

Optional: Hit report endpoint to verify rendering.

📊 8. Monitoring & Logging
CloudWatch: EC2 health metrics

CloudWatch Logs / S3: System and install logs

GitLab Artifacts: Pipeline logs for audit

Slack / Email Notifications: Rebuild result

🛡️ 9. Security Considerations
Use IAM roles with least privilege for Terraform and EC2.

Store secrets in GitLab CI/CD variables (e.g., DB credentials, license keys).

Ensure AMIs are scanned for vulnerabilities monthly.

📅 10. Schedule

Task	Frequency
AMI Rebuild	Monthly
CI/CD Pipeline	Scheduled or manual
Health Checks	Post-deployment
Alert Review	As needed
🔄 11. Rollback Plan
Retain previous AMI (tag as stable)

Include a manual rollback stage in the pipeline

Optionally snapshot BOXI data/config before deletion

